# Active Work

Active Work Items preserve temporary execution state only when a task spans sessions, stages, or an explicit handoff.

## Lifecycle

1. Create `.agents/work/active/YYYY-MM-DD-short-title.md` only when continuity requires it.
2. Record scope, current status, evidence, next safe action, blockers, and affected worktrees.
3. Update it at meaningful handoff points; do not use it as a command transcript.
4. On completion, move durable decisions to Agent Notes and current facts to owning docs.
5. Archive the completed item under `.agents/work/archive/` or remove it when no temporary evidence remains useful.

Active Work never owns architecture or policy.
